  "description": "Meet Glider—a cargo e-bike built to carry more with confidence and comfort. Its torque-sensing assist feels natural from the first pedal stroke, while the 52V system and hydraulic brakes keep rides smooth and controlled on city streets or rougher paths. With up to 62 miles of range, a 28 mph top speed, and a 440 lb payload, Glider turns errands, school runs, and weekend adventures into easy, enjoyable rides. Accessory kits let you tailor the setup for commuting, family duty, pets, or delivery work.\nQuick highlights\n\n750W (95 Nm) rear-hub motor with torque sensor for intuitive power.\n\n52V 15.6Ah battery • up to 62 miles per charge • top speed up to 28 mph.\n\nPayload capacity: 440 lb; recommended rider height 4'11\"–6'3\".\n\nHydraulic disc brakes; comfort-oriented suspension; fat-tire stability.\n\nCargo ecosystem: running boards, rear seat pad, front tray, panniers, and “Family/Commuter/Cargo” kits.",
